promptTemplate:
You are an enterprise decision scoring engine. Analyze the following business data and provide a risk/approval score.

INPUT DATA:
{{PAYLOAD}}

SCENARIO: {{SCENARIO}}

Respond ONLY with valid JSON in this exact format:
{
  "score": <number 0-100>,
  "confidence": <number 0-100>,
  "factors": [{"factor": "<name>", "impact": <-50 to +50>, "reason": "<text>"}],
  "recommendation": "<APPROVE|REJECT|REVIEW>",
  "explanation": "<one sentence>"
}
